"P3421423201" "During a heist a team of Goldbrickers got nabbed by a group called Wyvern, a bunch of freelance vigilantes who stick their noses where they don't belong. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Head over to the Wyvern hideout where they're interrogating the Goldbrickers and break them out.</A>"
