"P1829969118" "Break Goldbrickers out of Wyvern hideout"
// SendOffString :
"P2386497840" "Make sure you get the Goldbricker boss out, a guy by the name of Flashbang. He's the most valuable of that lot."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3898124067" "Do you want Wyvern to get all the Goldbricker secrets? Get going!"

