"P74337810" "Longbow has been watching the Goldbrickers like hawks lately, waiting for them to slip up. The Goldbrickers have a major heist planned, but they need a distraction - that'll be you. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Plant these bombs around one of the power transfer systems</A>. We'll send an anonymous 'tip' to Longbow letting them know that you're up to no good."
// AcceptString :
"P4140221202" "Set bombs at PTS"
// SendOffString :
"P4086530142" "The bombs have been loaded on a truck. The truck will take you past the perimeter security. From there you're on your own."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1071457723" "Get a move on! We need that distraction at the PTS!"

